---
import { DOMAINS } from '../data/scenarios';
---
<section id="work-done" class="section-rule">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Experience</p>
      <h2>Where we've shipped.</h2>
      <p>
        SmashGlass is a boutique studio, so the work is deliberately narrow. These are the
        domains we know well enough to give you a straight answer in the first conversation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="domains">
      {DOMAINS.map((d) => (
        <article class="dom" style={`--c: var(--color-${d.color})`}>
          <div class="dom-head">
            <span class="n">{d.n}</span>
            <h3>{d.title}</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="sum">{d.summary}</p>
          <ul class="tags">
            {d.work.map((w) => <li>{w}</li>)}
          </ul>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="engage">
      <div class="eng-col">
        <span class="lbl">How engagements start</span>
        <p>
          Most begin as a fixed-price project in the $1,500&ndash;$5,000 range &mdash; one
          clearly bounded problem, scoped before anyone commits. That is deliberate: it is
          the fastest way for both sides to find out whether working together is any good.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="eng-col">
        <span class="lbl">What you own at the end</span>
        <p>
          Source, tests, documentation, and deployment. No proprietary runtime, no retainer
          required to keep it running, and nothing that stops working if you stop paying us.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .domains {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1px;
    background: var(--color-rule); border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .domains { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .dom {
    background: var(--color-ink-2); padding: 28px 26px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 13px; transition: background .22s;
  }
  .dom:hover { background: var(--color-graphite); }

  .dom-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; }
  .dom-head .n {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--c);
  }
  .dom-head h3 { font-size: 1.08rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }

  .sum { font-size: 0.89rem; color: var(--color-mute); line-height: 1.6; }

  .tags {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;
    list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 4px 0 0;
  }
  .tags li {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.63rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-mute-2); border: 1px solid var(--color-rule-2);
    border-radius: 2px; padding: 4px 8px;
  }

  .engage {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px);
    margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .engage { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 26px; } }
  .eng-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .eng-col .lbl {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-mute-2);
  }
  .eng-col p { font-size: 0.93rem; color: var(--color-mute); line-height: 1.62; max-width: 46ch; }
</style>
